{"v":4,"catch":"雙搖桿射擊遊戲設定在武器計劃失敗後的反烏托邦後果中。","desc":"作為輻射清理者探索失敗的武器計劃的深度。 Dungeon Core 是一款具有挑戰性但有益的地牢探索遊戲。它具有程序生成的關卡，其中有許多可供探索的房間、可供尋找的物品和需要戰鬥的敵人。永久升級將幫助您改進您的任務，並且這些升級將永遠伴隨您。深入地下並探索不同的環境，並通過變種人和老闆來實現最終目標，從內部摧毀核心。","publisher":"Talismanic","release":"2023-03-02","genres":["動作","冒險"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["英文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/cf703231076a3af8f31e5c5e29db2d586a1c3e5d68eec8d910f2e278af48ba39.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/418c292fd68395f7cf106c2e5356a867c10a3edc0bdfafd88cc182f41d565df2.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/64c36fce5cc58fbd9bd5e5d26080e868a1880285961127ec3b39447c685e13d0.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/96e628407f1234482695e7db263f360d51915e7e49896534e8d6f608c76a4d22.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/702d9022fa89fe873323a094ee228cacc2fc36532dbfd79efa139b37b6fd6a42.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/e63060e4758a38dec34df0f8f388fdc8b0081dcfcfda65a81f72ec7ef746b3f9.jpg"],"titleId":"0100a3101a4e6000","dlc":[]}